{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 34, :comments ["<b>And on the lampstand four cups.</b> On the body of the lampstand itself were four cups — one protruding on it below the branches, and the three above where the branches emerge from its sides." "<b>Like almond blossoms, its calyxes and its flowers.</b> This is one of five verses that have no resolution (Yoma 52) — it is not known whether the cups were almond-shaped, or whether its calyxes and its flowers were almond-shaped."], :book :exodus, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 25, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T08:54:33.100622778Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}